      "v": 4,
      "zh": "约瑟就在主人眼前蒙恩，伺候他主人，并且主人派他管理家务，把一切所有的都交在他手里。",
      "en": "So Joseph found favor in his sight and became his personal attendant.[NOTE:1] Potiphar appointed Joseph[NOTE:2] overseer of his household and put him in charge[NOTE:3] of everything he owned.",
